AWS DevOps Interview Preparation Series — AWS ECR🚀

Topic: Amazon ECR (Elastic Container Registry) — Secure, Scalable, and Fully Managed Container Image Registry.

As part of my AWS DevOps Interview Preparation Series, today’s focus is on Amazon ECR, one of the most essential services for container-based DevOps pipelines.

If you’re using Docker, ECS, EKS, or CI/CD pipelines, then mastering ECR is crucial — it’s the backbone of image management in AWS!

